# Base URL of the TokTickIT API. Copy to ".env" for local dev.
# Lab 3 (C-56): empty on purpose. The Vite dev server proxies /api to the API,
# so the client calls same-origin paths and the session cookie travels with
# them. It must be set to the empty string, not left out: api.ts uses ??, and
# an unset variable would fall back to the cross-origin http://localhost:3000.
VITE_API_URL=""
